:["evopred_ruler_eats_age","evopred_ruler_eats_agenda","evopred_ruler_eats_negative","evopred_ruler_eats_positive","funeral_option_authoritarian","funeral_option_egalitarian","funeral_option_materialist","funeral_option_megacorp","funeral_option_militarist","funeral_option_negative_traits","funeral_option_pacifist","funeral_option_plantoid_fungoid","funeral_option_private","funeral_option_public","funeral_option_spiritualist","funeral_option_xenophile","funeral_option_xenophobe"]},{"id":"paragon.552","kind":"event","title":{"zh":"私密葬礼","en":"A Private Funeral"},"texts":[{"zh":"[From.GetName]在最亲近的亲属和同事的环绕中静静地沉眠。其对[Root.GetName]的贡献不菲，但现在并不是能铺张浪费的时候。","en":"[From.GetName] is laid to rest in a private ceremony with their closest family members and colleagues. Their contribution to the [Root.GetName] was an important one, but now is not the time for exorbitant expenditure."}],"sections":[],"image":"art/3e7efae8f36c4b35040a.webp","hidden":false,"choices":[{"key":"paragon.552.a","label":{"zh":"一场合适的告别仪式。","en":"An appropriate farewell."},"responses":[],"tooltips":[],"conditional":false,"next":[],"terminal":false}],"next":[],"source":{"file":"events/paragon_events.txt","line":3663}},{"id":"paragon.551","kind":"event","title":{"zh":"公开葬礼","en":"A Public Funeral"},"texts":[{"zh":"在长长的游行队伍中，[From.GetName]静静地沉眠，[Root.GetName]的每一位公民都受邀前来表示敬意。\n\n葬礼之后是为期一周的盛大祭典，祭典花费巨大。[From.GetName]的透明水晶棺材在[Root.Capital.GetName]纪念堂展出。人群排在街头，想要一睹他们伟大领袖的最终安息之处。","en":"[From.GetName] has been laid to rest following a public procession. Every citizen of [Root.GetName] was invited to pay their respects.\n\nThe funeral is followed by a week-long festival, with no expenses spared. [From.GetName]'s translucent crystal casket is displayed at the [Root.Capital.GetName] memorial site, where the crowds line the streets hoping to catch a glimpse of the great leader in their final resting place."}],"sections":[],"image":"art/99740b72d6e183ec724d.webp","hidden":false,"choices":[{"key":"paragon.551.a","label":{"zh":"一场恰当的送别仪式。","en":"A fitting send-off."},"responses":[],"tooltips":[],"conditional":false,"next":[],"terminal":false}],"next":[],"source":{"file":"events/paragon_events.txt","line":3638}},{"id":"paragon.553","kind":"event","title":{"zh":"即将到来的死亡","en":"An Awaited Death"},"texts":[{"zh":"我们对[From.GetTitle][From.GetName]的谨慎处置被媒体迅速捕捉到了。尽管一些人表达了担忧，但许多消息来源还是坚定地指出了这位领袖的缺点。当前的普遍看法是，我们终于可以找一位更合适的继任者来替代现在这位领袖了。","en":"The discreet disposal of our [From.GetTitle], [From.GetName], has been promptly noted by the press. While others express concern, many sources adamantly point out the leader's shortcomings. The general sentiment is relief that we can now replace this leader with a more fitting successor."}],"sections":[],"image":"art/1d32ec9e4fd15a0cdff0.webp","hidden":false,"choices":[{"key":"paragon.553.a","label":{"zh":"是时候向前看了。","en":"It is time to move on."},"responses":[],"tooltips":[],"conditional":false,"next":[],"terminal":false}],"next":[],"source":{"file":"events/paragon_events.txt","line":3688}},{"id":"paragon.554","kind":"event","title":{"zh":"生不带来，死不带走","en":"From Matter to Matter"},"texts":[{"zh":"在一场简短的追悼会后，[From.GetTitle]的遗体被捐赠给了科学界，以对基础医药研究和教育继续做贡献。\n\n这些过程中剩下的东西最终将被水火化，变成富含矿物质的肥料，确保身体的任何部分都不会被浪费。","en":"After a brief commemoration, the [From.GetTitle]'s body has been donated to science to contribute towards essential medical research and education.\n\nWhat is left from these procedures will in the end be water cremated and turned into a mineral-rich fertilizer, ensuring no part of the body goes to waste."}],"sections":[],"image":"art/8d5475edf8f6f84b714c.webp","hidden":false,"choices":[{"key":"paragon.554.a","label":{"zh":"这就是生死的循环。","en":"Such is the cycle of life."},"responses":[],"tooltips":[],"conditional":false,"next":[],"terminal":false}],"next":[],"source":{"file":"events/paragon_events.txt","line":3713}},{"id":"paragon.555","kind":"event","title":{"zh":"悲伤的告别","en":"A Somber Departure"},"texts":[{"zh":"人们聚集在一起，追悼[From.GetName]的一生及其丰功伟绩。人们挤满了街道，向东望不见头，向西望不见尾。颂歌一直唱到了夜幕降临。[From.GetHeSheCap]现在已经跨入彼岸。\n\n[From.GetHisHer]的布道节选现在在整个帝国回荡，提醒着我们共同的目标。","en":"The people gathered in their masses to celebrate the life and career of [From.GetName]. Huge processions filled the streets, and hymns were sung long into the night. [From.GetHeSheCap] is now waiting for us on the other side of the veil.\n\nPopular excerpts from [From.GetHisHer] sermons are now reverberating across the empire, reminding us of our common goal."}],"sections":[],"image":"art/99740b72d6e183ec724d.webp","hidden":false,"choices":[{"key":"paragon.555.a","label":{"zh":"我们终将再会。","en":"Until we meet again."},"responses":[],"tooltips":[],"conditional":false,"next":[],"terminal":false}],"next":[],"source":{"file":"events/paragon_events.txt","line":3738}},{"id":"paragon.556","kind":"event","title":{"zh":"庄严卓著的送别","en":"A Distinguished Farewell"},"texts":[{"zh":"大型阅兵方阵和舰队护卫着[From.GetName]的灵柩前往最终安息之地。[From.GetHisHerCap]的遗体被发射去了最近的恒星，并全程向全社会广播。\n\n逝世领袖的个人战略部署和日志成为了下一批军校学员课程中的内容。","en":"A huge parade of troops and a flyover by naval forces marked the arrival of [From.GetName]'s casket to its final resting place. [From.GetHisHerCap] body was fired into the nearest star during a society-wide broadcast.\n\nThe departed leader's personal strategies and log books will become a part of the curriculum for the next generation of cadets."}],"sections":[],"image":"art/003cb28799e940afb381.webp","hidden":false,"choices":[{"key":"paragon.556.a","label":{"zh":"值得的送别。","en":"A worthy sendoff."},"responses":[],"tooltips":[],"conditional":false,"next":[],"terminal":false}],"next":[],"source":{"file":"events/paragon_events.txt","line":3763}},{"id":"paragon.557","kind":"event","title":{"zh":"基金","en":"Foundation"},"texts":[{"zh":"为了纪念刚刚去世的伟大[From.GetTitle]，[From.GetName]，我们设立了一个非盈利的基金会。这个基金会标志着星际的和平与和谐发展迈出了一步，包容了不同社群和物种之间的分歧。","en":"A non-profit foundation has been established to honor the passing of the great [From.GetTitle], [From.GetName]. The foundation marks a step towards peace and interstellar harmony, bridging differences between communities and species."}],"sections":[],"image":"art/f802cd0acb1c75cf3fda.webp","hidden":false,"choices":[{"key":"paragon.557.a","label":{"zh":"我们共同创造了一项遗产。","en":"A legacy has been created."},"responses":[],"tooltips":[],"conditional":false,"next":[],"terminal":false}],"next":[],"source":{"file":"events/paragon_events.txt","line":3788}},{"id":"paragon.558","kind":"event","title":{"zh":"传统的葬礼","en":"A Traditional Funeral"},"texts":[{"zh":"当[From.GetName]去世的消息传遍更远的地区时，一种深深的悲痛笼罩了整个帝国。无数的哀悼者遵循传统的葬礼仪式加入了[Root.Capital.GetName]的葬礼队伍中。\n\n其遗体被一丝不苟地清洁并进行了适当的装饰。在[From.GetTitle]的遗体进行了安葬之前，我们全国上下都要默哀，表示尊重。","en":"A deep sorrow has gripped the public as news regarding the passing of [From.GetName] spreads to the wider community. Countless mourners join the funeral procession on [Root.Capital.GetName] to follow the traditional funeral rites.\n\nThe body is meticulously cleansed and appropriately decorated. Before the deceased [From.GetTitle] is laid to rest, a moment of silence is observed throughout our systems as a mark of respect."}],"sections":[],"image":"art/99740b72d6e183ec724d.webp","hidden":false,"choices":[{"key":"paragon.558.a","label":{"zh":"我们皆是如此。","en":"This is our way."},"responses":[],"tooltips":[],"conditional":false,"next":[],"terminal":false}],"next":[],"source":{"file":"events/paragon_events.txt","line":3813}},{"id":"paragon.559","kind":"event","title":{"zh":"静默远航","en":"Silent Voyage"},"texts":[{"zh":"为纪念[From.GetName]一生的丰功伟绩，我们为[From.GetHimHer]准备了一场穿越星海的最后航行。\n\n一个容纳着[From.GetTitle]遗体的胶囊被庄严地发射向未探索的宇域，伴随他的还有诗歌、图表、录音和其他贵宾带来的随葬品。将来有一天，[From.GetTitle]的船只可能会在那里找到一个新家，完成[From.GetHisHer]的最后任务。","en":"The remarkable deeds of [From.GetName] have warranted [From.GetHimHer] one last voyage through space.\n\nA capsule containing the [From.GetTitle]'s remains is ceremonially launched into the void alongside poems, charts, recordings, and other memorabilia brought by various dignitaries. One day the [From.GetTitle]'s vessel may find a new home out there, completing [From.GetHisHer] final mission."}],"sections":[],"image":"art/0e49ae409ae009419e58.webp","hidden":false,"choices":[{"key":"paragon.559.a","label":{"zh":"去往繁星之间吧。","en":"Go now, to the stars."},"responses":[],"tooltips":[],"conditional":false,"next":[],"terminal":false}],"next":[],"source":{"file":"events/paragon_events.txt","line":3838}},{"id":"paragon.560","kind":"event","title":{"zh":"高耸的塑像","en":"A Towering Figure"},"texts":[{"zh":"工匠们获得最好的材料来制作[From.GetName]的肖像，将其加入到[Root.GetName]传奇英雄的行列中。其庄严的面孔被蚀刻在石头和金属上，让人们牢记这位强大领袖的丰功伟绩。","en":"Artisans have been provided with the finest materials to fashion the likeness of [From.GetName], adding them to the long line of storied heroes of the [Root.GetName]. Their majestic visage is etched in stone and metal, acting as a reminder of what strong leaders can accomplish."}],"sections":[],"image":"art/440a0089fc55f62e7ff6.webp","hidden":false,"choices":[{"key":"paragon.560.a","label":{"zh":"您的伟大将被永远铭记。","en":"Your strength will be remembered."},"responses":[],"tooltips":[],"conditional":false,"next":[],"terminal":false}],"next":[],"source":{"file":"events/paragon_events.txt","line":3863}},{"id":"paragon.561","kind":"event","title":{"zh":"铭记","en":"Name on the Wall"},"texts":[{"zh":"[From.GetName]的名字与头衔被镌刻在了一座高大耸立的纪念碑上，与无数其他为[Root.GetName]的人民鞠躬尽瘁的人们并列。这位备受尊敬的[From.GetTitle]将被人民永远铭记，他的贡献为未来数代领袖们开拓道路。","en":"[From.GetName]'s name and title are carved on a towering monument alongside others who have served the [Root.GetName] for the good of its population. The respected [From.GetTitle] will be fondly remembered by the people, paving the way for future generations of leaders."}],"sections":[],"image":"art/b5b98f79f5dbf09b044a.webp","hidden":false,"choices":[{"key":"paragon.561.a","label":{"zh":"为了大众的福祉。","en":"For the good of the many."},"responses":[],"tooltips":[],"conditional":false,"next":[],"terminal":false}],"next":[],"source":{"file":"events/paragon_events.txt","line":3888}},{"id":"paragon.562","kind":"event","title":{"zh":"地标","en":"Landmark"},"texts":[{"zh":"这位领袖的去世引起了星际证交所短暂但剧烈的震荡。\n\n除了举办奢华的葬礼，[Root.GetName]还将一座较高的摩天楼重命名为[From.GetName]大厦以确保以后这位[From.GetTitle]的名字会被写入公司的编年史中。每间会议室的墙上都挂着一幅经过艺术诠释的肖像，以纪念其对帝国的杰出贡献。","en":"News of the leader's passing is met with a sharp, but brief downturn in share value at the galactic stock markets.\n\nIn addition to sponsoring the lavish funeral, [Root.GetName] rebrands one of its taller skyscrapers as the [From.GetName] Building to ensure that the late [From.GetTitle]'s name is preserved in the annals of the corporate history. An artistically interpreted portrait is also hung on every boardroom wall to commemorate their outstanding contributions to the empire."}],"sections":[],"image":"art/3e7efae8f36c4b35040a.webp","hidden":false,"choices":[{"key":"paragon.562.a","label":{"zh":"剪彩吧。","en":"Cut the ribbon."},"responses":[],"tooltips":[],"conditional":false,"next":[],"terminal":false}],"next":[],"source":{"file":"events/paragon_events.txt","line":3913}},{"id":"paragon.563","kind":"event","title":{"zh":"新生命","en":"New Life"},"texts":[{"zh":"[From.Species.GetName]的去世并不像表面上看起来那么彻底。尽管躯干已经开始劣化，但核心还可以恢复活力。\n\n在浸泡过一种特殊的激素溶液后，[From.GetName]的遗体被小心翼翼地埋入[burial_planet.GetName]的土壤中。埋葬地由孵化者精心照料，他们耐心地等待幼体破土发芽，开始新的循环。","en":"The death of a [From.Species.GetName] is not as final as it appears. Even if the main stem has begun to deteriorate, the roots can be reinvigorated.\n\nAfter soaking in a special hormone solution, [From.GetName]'s remains are carefully buried in the soil of [burial_planet.GetName]. The burial site is tended by brood members who patiently await for younglings to sprout on the surface, starting the cycle anew."}],"sections":[],"image":"art/c5d06aa2b857db6d15c4.webp","hidden":false,"choices":[{"key":"paragon.563.a","label":{"zh":"从此生到彼生。","en":"From one life to the next."},"responses":[],"tooltips":[],"conditional":false,"next":[],"terminal":false}],"next":[],"source":{"file":"events/paragon_events.txt","line":3938}},{"id":"paragon.571","kind":"event","title":{"zh":"[root.GetGestaltEntityName]永存","en":"The [root.GetGestaltEntityName] Endures"},"texts":[{"zh":"[From.GetTitle][From.GetName]的意识在[From.GetAge]岁时从集体意识中移除。我们是[Root.GetName]，我们将永存。","en":"The mind of [From.GetTitle] [From.GetName] was removed from the collective at the age of [From.GetAge]. We are the [Root.GetName]. We will endure."}],"sections":[],"image":"art/36528f0917466f66e520.webp","hidden":false,"choices":[{"key":"paragon.571.a","label":{"zh":"我们将永存。","en":"We will endure."},"responses":[],"tooltips":[],"conditional":false,"next":[],"terminal":false}],"next":[],"source":{"file":"events/paragon_events.txt","line":4013}},{"id":"paragon.570","kind":"event","title":{"zh":"死亡驱役","en":"Servitude in Death"},"texts":[{"zh":"[From.GetTitle][From.GetName]在可靠地服务了[From.GetYearsOfService]后发生了故障，彻底报废。我们的科学家已经备份了文件以保留重要数据。\n\n基于[From.GetName]的智能全息图谱已经被安装在我们的舰船系统中，作为虚拟顾问为我们服务。他们将继续支援我们的任务。","en":"[From.GetTitle] [From.GetName] has broken down after [From.GetYearsOfService] of reliable service. Our scientists have backed up their files to preserve important data.\n\nAn intelligent hologram based on [From.GetName] has been installed in our ship systems to serve as a virtual advisor. They will continue to aid in our mission."}],"sections":[],"image":"art/53283e01115c7b762068.webp","hidden":false,"choices":[{"key":"paragon.570.a","label":{"zh":"死亡不再是一项障碍了。","en":"Death is no longer an obstacle."},"responses":[],"tooltips":[],"conditional":false,"next":[],"terminal":false}],"next":[],"source":{"file":"events/paragon_events.txt","line":3974}}]}